            "review_title": "Review at Happy Vegan",
            "review_text": "Samantha B\n1 contribution\n0\nAffordable, vegan, tasty, locally-owned restaurant in An Thuong\nJan 2021\nAmazing new 100% vegan restaurant in An Thuong! Dishes are cooked by a lovely local family that uses quality ingredients (no msg!) and lots of plant-based flavor. The menu has plenty of options-- including Vietnamese soups like My Quang and Pho, veggie sushi, salads, unique appetizers, and bibimbap. I highly recommend the \"water fern salad\" as it's a local dish that is hard to find vegan like this 💕 Happy Vegan also has drinks like juices, coconut, and drip coffee. \noh, and everything is very reasonably priced! \n**5/5 totally recommend** 😀\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 19, 2021",
